WEBVTT

1
00:40:08.375 --> 00:40:09.958
<i>I don’t embroider handkerchiefs</i>

2
00:40:10.625 --> 00:40:12.583
<i>And you don’t break contracts</i>

3
00:40:13.458 --> 00:40:15.541
<i>I don’t kill out of jealousy</i>

4
00:40:15.625 --> 00:40:17.500
<i>And you don’t die for me</i>

5
00:40:18.125 --> 00:40:19.916
<i>And before you love me</i>

6
00:40:20.625 --> 00:40:22.666
<i>Like you love a cat</i>

7
00:40:23.333 --> 00:40:25.625
<i>I’ll leave with anyone</i>

8
00:40:25.708 --> 00:40:28.500
<i>Who looks like you</i>

9
00:40:29.500 --> 00:40:31.375
<i>I open the…</i>

10
00:40:39.666 --> 00:40:42.083
<i>The peace that you have chosen</i>

11
00:40:42.166 --> 00:40:44.625
<i>Is worse than my war</i>

12
00:40:44.708 --> 00:40:47.000
<i>What could have been</i>

13
00:40:47.083 --> 00:40:49.833
<i>And what will never be</i>

14
00:40:52.083 --> 00:40:54.250
<i>I. on the other hand. never knew</i>

15
00:40:54.333 --> 00:40:57.291
<i>How to go with the wind</i>

16
00:40:57.375 --> 00:40:59.333
<i>That bites the corners</i>

17
00:40:59.416 --> 00:41:02.208
<i>Of this impious city</i>

18
00:41:02.291 --> 00:41:04.541
<i>Poor sorcerer’s apprentice</i>

19
00:41:04.625 --> 00:41:07.500
<i>Who spits at the sky…</i>
